            <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-ink-900 p-5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-cream-50/60">
                <span>Cuộc gọi đến · 14:31</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-amber-400/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-semibold text-amber-300">Chưa xác minh</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">0918 765 432</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cream-50/60">Số lạ, không có trong danh bạ</p>

              <div class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">1</span>
                  Cảnh báo trước khi bắt máy
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">2</span>
                  Khoảng dừng 60 giây
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">3</span>
                  Hỏi Mã gia đình · gọi lại số đã lưu
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-jade-500 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">4</span>
                  Gia đình gọi lại trong 2 phút
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-semibold">
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">SMS</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">Zalo</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">Telegram</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-cream-50/60">Chỉ gửi khi đồng ý</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-amber-400 px-4 py-3 text-ink-950">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold">30.000.000 ₫ được giữ lại</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Kịch bản Bà Lan</span>
